  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Melamine is a&nbsp;nitrogen-based compound&nbsp;used by many manufacturers to create a number of products, especially plastic dish ware. It&#39;s also used in&nbsp;plastic products, Dry-erase boards.&nbsp; It is formed by condensation polymerisation of&nbsp; formaldehyde and melamine.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b89d1cd2-d9bd-42d2-8579-88df2c49fc2e-9754458_Answer.png\" style=\"width: 504px; height: 335px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
